# Crystal Imperium play test: DexNav hidden Pokemon (detector mode, on from the start).
# Every 100 steps DexNav has a 25% chance to detect a hidden Pokemon nearby; the player then
# creeps (holds A) up to it and a battle starts. Each run sets the step counter to 99 and takes
# one step, so each run has the 25% chance. Twelve runs must detect at least one, and every
# detection must lead to a battle. The Infinite Repel keeps ordinary wild battles away.
!new_game()
!give_mon(155, 5)
!warp(0, 11, 0)
!use_key_item(1)
!walkto(34, 14, "yx")
!walkto(24, 14)
savestate grass.ss
!dexnav_hidden_sample(12)
expecttally hidden_detected 1 12
expecttally hidden_battle 1 12
